graph TD
    A[Ion Channel Stimulus] --> B{Channel Type?}
    B -->|Voltage-Gated| C[Membrane Depolarization]
    B -->|Ligand-Gated| D[Ligand Binding]
    B -->|Mechanosensitive| E[Mechanical Force]
    
    C --> F[Channel Opening]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    
    F --> G[Ion Flow]
    G --> H[Membrane Potential Change]
    H --> I[Action Potential]
    I --> J[Signal Propagation]
    J --> K[Cellular Response]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    G --> L[Calcium Entry]
    L --> M[Calcium Signaling]
    M --> N[Intracellular Response]
    
    %% Termination
    K --> O[Channel Inactivation]
    O --> P[Ion Flow Cessation]
    P --> Q[Signal Termination]
    
    %% Feedback regulation
    K --> R[Channel Phosphorylation]
    R --> S[Channel Modulation]
    S --> T[Response Adaptation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    U[Voltage-Gated Channels] --> C
    V[Ligand-Gated Channels] --> D
    W[Mechanosensitive Channels] --> E
    X[Ion Pumps] --> P
    Y[Channel Kinases] --> R
    Z[Channel Phosphatases] --> S
    
